    {
      "flavor_text": "かんそうした　ばしょを　このむ。\nめ　から　みずを　だして　からだの\nすいぶんを　ちょうせつする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "건조한 장소를 좋아한다.\n눈에서 물을 내어 몸의\n수분을 조절한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il préfère les sols arides. Il évacue l’eau par ses yeux\npour réguler ses fluides corporels.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es bevorzugt trockene Gebiete. Es gibt über die Augen\nWasser ab, um den Wasserhaushalt zu regulieren.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para\najustar los niveles de fluido corporal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Preferisce le terre aride. Rilascia acqua dagli occhi\nper regolare il livello dei suoi fluidi corporei.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its\neyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "乾燥した　場所を　好む。\n目から　水を　出して\n体の　水分を　調節する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para\najustar los niveles de fluido corporal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かんそうした　くうきを　このむ。\nすいぶんを　ちょうせつ　するときに\nだす　みずが　なみだに　みえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "건조한 공기를 좋아한다.\n수분을 조절할 때에 내는 물이\n눈물처럼 보인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Adepte des climats secs, il régule son humidité en\nlaissant couler ce qui ressemble à des larmes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mag es trocken. Gleicht es seinen Wasserhaushalt aus,\nentweicht ihm Wasser, das wie Tränen geformt ist.",
